up pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay\" title=\"Finlay\">Finlay</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hop_%27N%27_Shop\" title=\"Hop &#39;N&#39; Shop\">Hop 'N' Shop</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eggs\" title=\"Eggs\">🥚</a>45</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Decoration</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Version_1.54.0\" title=\"Version 1.54.0\">v.1.54.0</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><i><big>\"<b>Hippity Hoppity!</b>\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"><b>Description</b></span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Easter Moai</b> is an item sold at the <a href=\"/wiki/Hop_%27N%27_Shop\" title=\"Hop &#39;N&#39; Shop\">Hop 'N' Shop</a> for <a href=\"/wiki/Eggs\" title=\"Eggs\">🥚</a>45. It is one of the variations of the <a href=\"/wiki/Moai\" title=\"Moai\">Moai</a> and has only the purpose of decoration.\n</p><p>The <b>Easter moai</b> appears very small compared to the others, it looks a lot like a rabbit.\n</p><p>There was a brief time where the <b>Easter Moai's</b> in-game name was replaced with its in-game description, and the description being its in-code name.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\"><b>Gallery</b></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"34362410ddcf687fbc8bf9be03ce826e\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:95px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Easter_moai-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:93px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Easter_moai.png\" title=\"Easter moai.png (840 KB)\" style=\"height:93px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/02/Easter_moai.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240518012414\" title=\"Easter moai.png (840 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Old location of the Easter moai\" height=\"93\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Easter moai.png\" data-image-key=\"Easter_moai.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Old location of the &lt;b&gt;Easter moai&lt;/b&gt;\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Easter moai.png (840 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Old location of the Easter moai\" height=\"93\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Easter moai.png\" data-image-key=\"Easter_moai.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Old location of the &lt;b&gt;Easter moai&lt;/b&gt;\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/02/Easter_moai.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240518012414\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Old location of the <b>Easter moai</b></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\"><b>History</b></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Was added in <a href=\"/wiki/Version_1.54.0\" title=\"Version 1.54.0\">Version 1.54.0</a>, On the <span class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyNF9FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2024 Easter event</span>;</li>\n<li>On the <span class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyNF9FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2024 Easter event</span>, it was sold at <a href=\"/wiki/Eggcelent_Deals\" title=\"Eggcelent Deals\">Eggcelent Deals</a>;</li>\n<li>On the <a href=\"/wiki/2025_Easter_event\" title=\"2025 Easter event\">2025 Easter event</a>, the price has been changed from $8,089 to <a href=\"/wiki/Eggs\" title=\"Eggs\">🥚</a>45.</li>\n<li>On the <a href=\"/wiki/2025_Easter_event\" title=\"2025 Easter event\">2025 Easter event</a>, it was sold at <a href=\"/wiki/Eggcelent_Deals\" title=\"Eggcelent Deals\">Hop 'N' Shop</a>;</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260830120512\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 68/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 49/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 27/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1758/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua m